{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"text\": \"那种熟悉的亲近忽然让他觉得向往的生活近在眼前，身体先绷紧，随后才意识到现实并没变。\",\n      \"key\": \"身体先绷紧\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他当初不肯再等，是怕珍惜的东西继续受损，光在心里想着那种生活也护不住它们。\",\n      \"key\": \"不肯再等\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他想重新投入，却已不能毫无顾忌，怕自己又只顾硬撑，把刚找回的温柔磨掉，连想留住的生活也顾不上。\",\n      \"key\": \"磨掉温柔\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他原以为想清为何不能再等就能安心，如今还得想怎样争取才不伤温柔，理由更多了，还是定不下来。\",\n      \"key\": \"理由更多\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"失效\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R32\", \"R35\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写合并\",\n      \"why\": \"把安宁后的落差写成身体先紧、随后意识到现实没变，补足突然惊醒和熟悉感带来的失落。删去没有珠子支撑的自责，不再说他懊恼自己忘了面对。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R33\", \"R34\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把不能只靠怀念改变现实落到他的具体顾虑：珍惜的东西可能继续受损，光在心里想着那种生活护不住它们。同时保留当初不肯再等的行动理由，找回上一轮修补中写弱了的现实压力。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R36\", \"R37\", \"R38\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他无法再像从前那样毫无顾忌地投入，以及害怕争取会耗掉温柔的冲突。把代价具体写成重演硬撑、磨掉刚找回的温柔，最后顾不上自己想留住的生活。R38只是重复两边的风险，合并后不再单列。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R39\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把新增的顾虑具体成既不能继续等，又得考虑怎样争取才不伤温柔。保留他原以为找到行动理由就能安心、如今仍无法定下来的变化，并解释紧张为何持续盘旋。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "115d2882-f309-464b-9336-b52ec491a5b5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T171028535606Z", "elapsed_seconds": 524.406, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T17:19:12.957992+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "37281a3a2f5e68d1bca6ad9f7d26e5d6ac2a17051ccc971f205ab739f710f519", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T17102